  "elevationPhilosophy": "Elevation is whisper-quiet — the dominant shadow pattern uses a cool purple-gray (47, 43, 67) at only 10% opacity, combined with a hairline inset top border. The result is depth that reads as paper layering, not digital UI elevation. Cards never float dramatically; they sit on the surface with the subtlety of printed matter.",
  "imagery": "Imagery is catalog-forward: colorful product previews (UI kits, mockups, font specimens) displayed inside rounded card frames. The cards themselves are neutral — white or paper — letting the illustrated previews carry the color. Decorative illustrations in the hero and section dividers use the full three-color accent palette (acid green, vermillion, magenta) at low saturation as soft radial gradient washes. No photography of people or environments; the site is entirely iconography, product crops, and brand-colored illustration. Iconography is outlined at ~1.5-2px stroke, monochrome black or accent-colored, with geometric simplicity matching the typeface.",
